["Why do exercise-calorie estimates differ?","Devices and machines use algorithms based on inputs and population assumptions; they do not directly measure the exact energy cost of every session."],
["How long should I wait before calling it a plateau?","Use a consistent multi-week trend rather than a few days. The appropriate observation period depends on the goal and the size of normal fluctuations."],
["Should I stop exercising if my weight is not falling?","Not solely because the scale is slow. Physical activity has benefits independent of weight loss, and the full plan should be assessed before removing it."]
