["How many calories do 10,000 steps burn?","There is no single accurate number for everyone because body size, pace, terrain and individual movement efficiency differ."],
["Are steps useful if I already exercise?","Yes. Steps capture everyday movement that a structured workout may not represent."],
["Should I increase steps or reduce calories first?","That depends on the person's routine and goal. Both activity and food intake can contribute to an overall weight-management strategy."]
